name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q9_2025'

question 'Which of these is a side effect that a pure function should avoid?'

wrong 'Returning a new array of filtered items.'
wrong 'Performing a calculation and returning the result.'
right 'Updating a global variable that tracks the "Total Users" outside the function.'
wrong 'Accepting two numbers as inputs.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 7

Pure functions should only interact with their own inputs and outputs. Changing a variable outside the function is a side effect that can lead to unpredictable bugs.
MARKDOWN
